	(property "Description" "MATEK I2C-INA-BM, INA228 (or INA238) current and voltage monitor, 27 x 20mm, I2C address 0x45 by default (print: 69, decimal). Shunt in the plus line between BAT+ and ESC+. Pads 1-4: left JST-GH 4-pin 5V SCL SDA G; pads 5-8: right JST-GH 4-pin G SDA SCL 5V; 9 BAT+; 10 ESC+. 5V input 4-9V (maker). Pads 1-8 mark the connector leads; the bench connects through a JST-GH cable. Drawn from the maker's 3D model and photo."
		(at 0 0 0)
		(unlocked yes)
		(layer "F.Fab")
		(hide yes)
